			],
			"Message": "style(Mountain): Apply consistent formatting across command handlers, IPC dispatchers, and environment providers\n\nStandardize whitespace and formatting across Mountain's command registration, language feature providers, SCM integration, tree view handlers, document provider, file watcher, keybinding commands, native host dialogs, and WindServiceHandlers dispatcher modules:\n\n- Remove extraneous blank lines after function signatures, struct definitions, impl blocks, and match arms across 200+ files\n- Normalize import organization: group use declarations, remove trailing blank lines\n- Condense single-statement methods and lock acquisition patterns to single-line format\n- Standardize dev_log! macro argument alignment and line breaks across provider handlers\n- Fix struct field spacing in DTOs and response types\n- Introduce UICommandDispatcher for decorations, commands, and extensions command routing\n- Refactor dispatcher modules to use consistent match expression formatting with inline arms\n\nNo functional changes — purely mechanical formatting cleanup for consistency across Mountain's command layer, IPC dispatchers, environment providers, and service handlers.",
			"SHA": "f474716d305aedce20510fc893e59e4770458879"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-07T17:04:19Z",
			"File": [
				"⡿⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1764,
				300
			],
			"Message": "style(Mountain): Apply consistent formatting across Air client, application state, providers, and RPC services\n\nStandardize whitespace and formatting across Mountain's Air integration layer, application state DTOs and internal modules, environment provider implementations, IPC command handlers, extension management, and Cocoon gRPC service handlers:\n\n- Remove extraneous blank lines after struct field definitions, impl blocks, and function signatures across 150+ files\n- Normalize import organization: group use declarations, remove trailing blank lines\n- Condense single-statement methods and lock acquisition patterns to single-line format\n- Standardize dev_log! macro argument alignment and line breaks across provider handlers\n- Fix struct field spacing in AirServiceTypesStub DTOs and ApplicationState DTOs\n- Add WorkingCopyDispatcher and WorkspaceDispatcher for WindServiceHandlers command routing\n- Remove unused allow attributes from Library.rs (non_snake_case, non_camel_case_types, etc.)\n\nNo functional changes — purely mechanical formatting cleanup for consistency across Mountain's Air client, application state persistence, extension scanner, memento loader, recovery utilities, serialization, text processing, command registration, provider traits, IPC handlers, and Cocoon gRPC service layer.",
			"SHA": "ab55eef46fbe796248c0b1748ae09aa3d5e063c8"
		},
