			],
			"Message": "style(Mountain): Apply consistent formatting across RPC providers and service modules\n\nStandardize whitespace and formatting across Mountain's gRPC service layer, CocoonService providers, SCM, terminal, tree view, and telemetry modules:\n\n- Remove extraneous blank lines around imports, function bodies, and dev_log! macro invocations\n- Condense single-statement methods and lock acquisition patterns to single-line format\n- Normalize import organization: group use declarations, remove trailing blank lines\n- Standardize dev_log! argument alignment and line breaks across 30+ provider handlers\n- Fix struct field spacing in AirServiceTypesStub, ServiceMetrics, TraceSpan\n- Add new UrlDispatcher stub for URL command routing in WindServiceHandlers\n\nNo functional changes — purely mechanical formatting cleanup for consistency across Mountain's RPC layer, provider registry, SCM integration, terminal management, tree view coordination, and telemetry structures.",
